_⚠️ Potential issue_ | _🟠 Major_ | _⚡ Quick win_

**Add cURL timeouts and always close the handle.**

This transport can block indefinitely today, and the handle is never explicitly closed. Add connect/overall timeouts and `curl_close()` in a `finally` block to avoid request-thread stalls and resource buildup.



<details>
<summary>Suggested fix</summary>

```diff
