_⚠️ Potential issue_ | _🟠 Major_ | _⚡ Quick win_

**Handle save request failures to avoid stuck saving state.**

On Line 186, `saving` is set to `true`, but there is no failure handler on the request path (Line 195+). If the request fails, the UI can stay stuck in saving mode.



<details>
<summary>Suggested fix</summary>

```diff
 						$.post({
