**Move the site existence check before token persistence.**

At **Line 128**, the null guard is correct, but `set_transient(...)` already ran earlier (Lines 122-124). If site lookup fails, this leaves an orphaned token until TTL expiry. Reordering `wu_get_site($site_id)` before token generation/storage avoids unnecessary transient writes.

