_🎯 Functional Correctness_ | _🟡 Minor_ | _⚡ Quick win_

**Ensure the locale is consistently overridden in test environments.**

Since `class-recommended-plugins-installer.php` uses `determine_locale()` when available, filtering only the `locale` hook might not be sufficient. In some environments or contexts (like when running tests as an admin with an assigned user locale), `determine_locale()` bypasses the global `locale` filter entirely or applies its own `determine_locale` filter instead. 

To ensure the test reliably mocks the locale and avoids flaky test failures, filter both `locale` and `determine_locale`.



<details>
<summary>🛠️ Proposed fix to mock both filters</summary>

```diff
 	private function get_steps_for_locale($locale): array {

 		$locale_filter = static function () use ($locale) {
 			return $locale;
 		};

 		add_filter('locale', $locale_filter);
+		add_filter('determine_locale', $locale_filter);

 		try {
 			return Recommended_Plugins_Installer::get_instance()->get_steps();
 		} finally {
 			remove_filter('locale', $locale_filter);
+			remove_filter('determine_locale', $locale_filter);
 		}
 	}
```
