body:
@coderabbitai Fixed in 434e1a76. The retry child now receives the inherited environment with `PHPUNIT_BATCH_NUMBER=0`, so a retry targets its supplied test file rather than the parent batch selection (`scripts/run-phpunit-batches.php:255-263`).

Verified with `php -l scripts/run-phpunit-batches.php` and `vendor/bin/phpcs scripts/run-phpunit-batches.php`.

